@startuml kairos-create-edit-kgroup-details-sequence
title Create or Edit K-Group

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open "Add K-Group" form
Admin -> WebAdmin: Fill data\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /kgroups {data}
API -> DB: INSERT KGroup
DB --> API: New id
API --> WebAdmin: 201 Created

Admin -> WebAdmin: Edit K-Group\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: PUT /kgroups/{id} {changes}
API -> DB: UPDATE KGroup
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

@enduml
